stic 100-row owner-review packet containing exactly five accepted rows per cell with at least 90% owner acceptance. Replay the frozen rights, truthful AI-assisted provenance, secret, PII, benchmark-decontamination, tokenizer, chat-template, assistant-and-tool-only masking, 4K-fit, language, punctuation, factual-grounding, safety, tool-result-verification, exact-duplicate, split-overlap, and 5-token-shingle 128-permutation MinHash 0.9 gates. Retain only accepted final-channel candidate text; retain rejected new attempts only as validation error, non-sensitive finish_reason, usage token counts, and request/response-envelope hashes without raw candidate or reasoning text. Stop early when the 850-row or 75%-per-cell threshold becomes mathematically impossible, write one aggregate cell-level failure report, and do not enter a one-row repair loop. Maximum 60 additional instance-minutes / $4.29 before tax at $4.29 per hour / 0 additional model or runtime download bytes / 1 GiB additional private writes / 260 sequential inference calls / 44 retry calls / 216 additional accepted outputs. It may restart and then cleanly stop only the bound canary container, serve only on remote localhost through pinned SSH, run the full frozen 1,000-record machine gate, and prepare the deterministic 100-row owner-review packet. No external API, public port, model or runtime download, S3 action, broader regeneration, 3.2M-token bulk generation, registry change, dataset seal, SFT training, production promotion, unrelated access, new instance, or termination."
